22
00:02:15,220 --> 00:02:20,240
And since your Jinzo had a strength
of 2400, so does my Valkyrie.

23
00:02:21,540 --> 00:02:22,997
Now, for the fun part.

24
00:02:23,080 --> 00:02:26,000
Attack his life point with Galloping Gash.

25
00:02:27,140 --> 00:02:28,060
Oh, no!

26
00:02:28,460 --> 00:02:30,225
One more attack and he's done!

27
00:02:31,360 --> 00:02:32,640
Right you are.

28
00:02:32,860 --> 00:02:35,640
So let's finish this off
with my triple threat.

29
00:02:37,460 --> 00:02:38,780
Thanks for playing.

30
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:41,000
Oh, man!

31
00:02:41,280 --> 00:02:42,480
Joey lost the door!

32
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:44,680
Look on the bright side.

33
00:02:45,100 --> 00:02:48,380
Kaiba Corp may have some
lovely parting gifts for you.

34
00:02:48,800 --> 00:02:51,417
I don't think that's
gonna be necessary, pal.

35
00:02:51,500 --> 00:02:53,680
Joey's still in the duel! But how?

36
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:56,260
No one could survive that onslaught.

37
00:02:56,360 --> 00:03:00,397
Unless, of course, they happen to have a
handy little magic card in their corner.

38
00:03:00,480 --> 00:03:02,600
Like Hyper Refresh, for instance.

39
00:03:03,900 --> 00:03:08,194
It doubled my strength right before
your little pony sisters attacked me.

40
00:03:11,240 --> 00:03:13,660
So my life points never hit zero.

41
00:03:14,780 --> 00:03:18,060
Which means I'm still
in the game, Zig Freak.

42
00:03:18,360 --> 00:03:20,677
Yes, but that won't last long.

43
00:03:20,760 --> 00:03:24,780
