must now clear the field.

45
00:03:28,900 --> 00:03:30,800
And back in my deck they go.

46
00:03:34,660 --> 00:03:35,717
Thank you, ladies.

47
00:03:35,800 --> 00:03:37,329
It's been such a pleasure.

48
00:03:37,480 --> 00:03:39,037
We must do this again soon.

49
00:03:39,120 --> 00:03:41,437
You can talk to your cards
till you're blue in the face.

50
