You're still not going
to win this duel, Ziggy.

51
00:03:44,240 --> 00:03:46,460
You're wide open and it's my move.

52
00:03:49,260 --> 00:03:50,280
Mr. Keibel,

53
00:03:50,480 --> 00:03:52,377
we've isolated the virus and rebuilt the

54
