70
00:04:52,820 --> 00:04:57,408
I don't know what to think, but right
now that freak is my number one suspect.

71
00:04:57,560 --> 00:05:00,220
He reminds me of a kid that I once met.

72
00:05:01,120 --> 00:05:05,340
A kid with the most dangerous
programming skills I've ever seen.

73
00:05:09,060 --> 00:05:10,020
Let's go.

74
00:05:10,300 --> 00:05:11,560
Time is money.

75
