Beating you is more fun than I thought.

88
00:05:54,780 --> 00:05:55,780
Just go.

89
00:05:56,000 --> 00:05:59,060
Fine, I'll begin by
activating this magic card.

90
00:05:59,720 --> 00:06:00,896
