98
00:06:25,380 --> 00:06:28,600
Now I must call upon the
three divine sisters.

99
00:06:37,940 --> 00:06:44,597
Now it's one underdog against three divas
You mean four divas Now let the fun begin

100
00:06:44,680 --> 00:06:50,920
with the goddess Skull Activate your
scepter of revelation Und foresee the future

101
00:06:51,660 --> 00:06:54,457
Each turn from now on
I'm able to seize the

102
00:06:54,540 --> 00:06:56,717
top three cards in your deck Und rearrange

103
