them any which way I please That's not fair
Joey's future isn't looking too bright,

104
00:07:02,940 --> 00:07:03,770
guys

105
00:07:07,840 --> 00:07:08,899
Interesting cards.

106
00:07:09,140 --> 00:07:12,022
Let's start by placing
the middle one on the top,

107
00:07:12,120 --> 00:07:15,100
then the first card,
and then the third, eh?

108
00:07:16,020 --> 00:07:19,157
I don't see what good that's
gonna do, but it's your call.

109
00:07:19,240 --> 00:07:22,760
You'll understand once I
call upon Goddess Verdanda.

110
00:07:24,080 --> 00:07:26,957
Her Scepter of Guidance
gives me the opportunity to

111
