150
00:09:16,400 --> 00:09:19,812
Thanks to my goddesses, I
already know you drew a monster.

151
00:09:19,940 --> 00:09:23,380
Namely, Knight of Dark
Dragon. You're right!

152
00:09:24,140 --> 00:09:24,970
Yes.

153
00:09:25,060 --> 00:09:27,060
