best monsters one by one!

155
00:09:33,140 --> 00:09:37,837
I have a feeling that's been Siegfried's
strategy since the beginning of the duel.

156
00:09:37,920 --> 00:09:40,497
He's using his magic ring
and his three goddesses

157
00:09:40,580 --> 00:09:43,700
