a spin before each one of my turns.

164
00:10:10,040 --> 00:10:12,917
And what it does to you depends
on what numbers come up.

165
00:10:13,000 --> 00:10:16,412
So you're depending on Lady
Luck to win this duel for you.

166
00:10:16,760 --> 00:10:19,597
Well, I guess you can't depend
on skill now, can't you?

167
00:10:19,680 --> 00:10:22,621
It took more than luck to
get me where I am today.

168
00:10:22,780 --> 00:10:24,360
And I'm about to prove it.

169
00:10:24,520 --> 00:10:26,377
Hold that thought. My move.

170
00:10:26,460 --> 00:10:30,960
This is the part where you show me
your top three cards. Excellent.

171
00:10:31,260 --> 00:10:35,084
Now place the second card on top,
then the first, then the third.

172
00:10:35,320 --> 00:10:39,360
Now to guess your top card,
I'll say Goblin Attack Force.

173
00:10:41,740 --> 00:10:44,480
Looks like Lady Luck's on my side.

174
00:10:44,680 --> 00:10:48,500
If he doesn't stop Siegfried
soon, he'll run out of monsters.

175
00:10:49,920 --> 00:10:52,940
I place this face down and end my turn.

176
00:10:53,820 --> 00:10:54,917
You think he's so cool?

177
00:10:55,000 --> 00:10:55,880
Watch this.

178
00:10:56,380 --> 00:11:00,340
Ah, thanks to my ring, that
monster in your hand is destroyed.

179
00:11:00,720 --> 00:11:01,720
That may be true.

180
00:11:01,960 --> 00:11:06,777
But now it's time to give the old one-armed
bandit a spin and see where things land.

181
00:11:06,860 --> 00:11:10,140
Come on, big bucks, no whammies. Yes!

182
00:11:10,820 --> 00:11:13,996
Looks like I can activate
special effect number three.

183
