Now I get to multiply my samurai's
attack points by the number I roll.

194
00:11:59,440 --> 00:12:02,220
He needs a five or a six. Come on.

195
00:12:04,880 --> 00:12:05,840
Oh, no.

196
00:12:06,980 --> 00:12:07,810
Hmm.

197
00:12:08,140 --> 00:12:11,964
You are so terrible at this game,
I actually find it frightening.

198
00:12:13,100 --> 00:12:13,930
Ah!

199
00:12:18,280 --> 00:12:21,180
You beat me fair and
square, mate. Good on you.

200
00:12:22,900 --> 00:12:25,637
