my adorable boyfriend...

201
00:12:25,720 --> 00:12:27,480
Hey, Yugi, I did it!

202
00:12:28,620 --> 00:12:29,680
Alright, Ziggy.

203
00:12:29,940 --> 00:12:32,037
Before you start guessing all my cards,

204
00:12:32,120 --> 00:12:35,857
I'm going to pick out a mystery
card just to keep you on your toes.

205
00:12:35,940 --> 00:12:38,757
So I'll just place this
little number face down.

206
00:12:38,840 --> 00:12:39,722
And that's all.

207
00:12:39,880 --> 00:12:42,697
Then it's time for my
goddesses to do their thing.

208
00:12:42,780 --> 00:12:44,260
so show me your cards.

209
00:12:45,560 --> 00:12:47,940
Place a middle card on top of your deck.

210
00:12:52,100 --> 00:12:56,040
And yet another one of your
monsters disappears never to return.

211
00:12:56,800 --> 00:12:59,900
