time to play my magic card.

212
00:13:00,220 --> 00:13:01,300
Swan Maiden.

213
00:13:01,620 --> 00:13:04,880
This lets me summon one
Valkyrie from my hand.

214
00:13:11,280 --> 00:13:12,520
She's too powerful.

215
00:13:12,780 --> 00:13:13,980
