my Dangerous Machine Type 6.

226
00:13:53,320 --> 00:13:55,080
Now show me some love.

227
00:13:56,480 --> 00:13:57,310
Ah, yeah.

228
00:13:57,700 --> 00:13:59,877
That means I draw an extra card, baby.

229
00:13:59,960 --> 00:14:02,060
And it looks like I'm on a roll.

230
00:14:02,280 --> 00:14:03,221
No pun intended.

231
