238
00:14:31,300 --> 00:14:32,360
Hold on!

239
00:14:32,620 --> 00:14:35,277
That trap card should have
been blown off the field!

240
00:14:35,360 --> 00:14:39,257
Apple of Enlightenment automatically
activates when it's taken off the field,

241
00:14:39,340 --> 00:14:42,752
which allows me to draw I draw
one more card from my deck.

242
