Plus, when my Logis' Flame leaves the
field, it allows me to activate this card.

243
00:14:48,200 --> 00:14:49,680
Valkyrie Brunhilde!

244
00:14:50,840 --> 00:14:56,400
She gains 300 attack points for every
warrior and dragon monster on the field,

245
00:14:56,520 --> 00:14:57,800
